# Every file here is signature-verified byte-for-byte. The Ed25519 signature
# covers the exact raw bytes of manifest.json, and every payload is bound by a
# SHA-256 recorded in that manifest. ANY end-of-line conversion, on any clone,
# on any platform, would change those bytes and break verification.
#
# Treat everything as binary so git never rewrites a single byte.
* -text
*.json -text
*.sig -text binary
*.btrp -text binary
